	<!-- EN: The measure of the faction's overall happiness. A high happiness means that any internal conflict within the settlement will lean heavily to your favor. -->
  <FactionHappinessDesc>衡量派系居民总体幸福感的标准.高幸福度对和解内部冲突极有帮助.</FactionHappinessDesc>
	<!-- EN: The measure of the faction's overall loyalty. The loyalty of a settlement determines how willing the settlement is to listen to you. A high loyalty will reduce the chance of defection. -->
  <FactionLoyaltyDesc>衡量派系居民总体是否忠诚的标准.忠诚度决定了内部冲突和解的意愿.高忠诚度可以减少叛逃的可能. </FactionLoyaltyDesc>
	<!-- EN: The measure of the faction's overall unrest. The higher unrest grows, the more likely dangerous events internal in your faction will spark. Let it grow too high, and a faction-wide revolt may grow. -->
  <FactionUnrestDesc>衡量派系总体动荡程度的标准.动乱越严重,你的派系内部就越有可能发生危险事件.高叛乱度会增加内部冲突.</FactionUnrestDesc>
	<!-- EN: The measure of the faction's overall prosperity. The prosperity of a town directly correlates with the production of resources. 50% prosperity = 50% production. If prosperity is damaged, it will slowly accumulate over time. -->
  <FactionProsperityDesc>衡量派系总体运行状况的标准.一个城镇的繁荣度与产量直接相关.50%繁荣度=50%产量.如果繁荣度受损,它将随着时间慢慢回复.</FactionProsperityDesc>

